      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUNDEEL FLYER (5) went close first-up at Cootamundra then wound up late to finish fifth last start over 1400m at Orange. Scored a comfortable maiden win over this distance at Goulburn last prep. Finds the perfect race at the third run back from a spell. I DOUBT IT (6) stepped up quickly to the mile at Queanbeyan last time out and just struggled in soft conditions. Saves her best for the 1600m here, with a win and two placings from three tries. Sure to play a major role. PERUNO (3) has been freshened up since failing to feature in a much stronger race at Moruya five weeks ago. Doesn't have a flattering record at this track but in a small field he is a player. NAGADEC (2) needed the run last time when down the track at Queanbeyan off a six-week break. Go on her impressive win two back over 1660m at Moruya. DELAGO SERG (4) is fitter for two runs back from a spell and is a winner here at today's distance.",
